OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen campaign on toxic
OL,4,Awaste sites wins Senedd backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenedd members from all parties have
OL,7,Furged Welsh ministers to work with the
OL,8,FUK government to make sure polluters
OL,9,Fpay for cleaning up contaminated land.
OL,11,FA motion introduced by Plaid Cymru MS
OL,12,FNiamh Salkeld, backed across party
OL,13,Flines, also calls for a UK fund to
OL,14,Finvestigate and remediate sites where
OL,15,Fcosts cannot be recovered, and for a
OL,16,Fframework to test affected land.
OL,18,FThe calls come after a BBC documentary
OL,19,Fby Michael Sheen examined claims toxic
OL,20,Fwaste poisoned people at 14 sites in
OL,21,FWales and England.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
